    2 - Melee

    3 - Special

    Q
    - Cycle weapon

    4-9, 0 - Eat / drink from inventory

    I - Inventory

    J
    - Achievements

    E / Click prompt - Use door

    Right Click + drag - Rotate
    camera

    Scroll - Zoom

    H - Hide / show UI

    Esc - Menu'
